@baseUrl = http://localhost:5128
@HostAddress = {{baseUrl}}
@companyAdminEmail = admin@al-salamah.com
@companyAdminPassword = User@123456
@deputyAdminEmail = deputy@al-salamah.com
@deputyAdminPassword = User@123456

### =====================================================================
### 11. DYNAMIC WORKFLOW TEMPLATE DESIGNER TEST SUITE (FR-WKF-01)
### =====================================================================
### Covers the workflow engine's template designer: the five standard Saudi service templates
### seeded for every tenant, full designer CRUD, the one-default-per-category rule, the archive
### guards, and the sovereign/operational authorization boundary.
###
### Authorization model under test:
###   Workflows.View   -> CompanyAdmin + DeputyAdmin, ConsultingEngineer, OperationsOfficer,
###                       MaintenanceManager, SalesRepresentative  (read the pipeline they work in)
###   Workflows.Manage -> CompanyAdmin only (redesigning a template changes how every future job
###                       in that category is processed — a sovereign capability, like branding
###                       and financial policy)
###
### Field casing is camelCase, verified against a running instance. See tech-debt item D-8 —
### the older suites in this folder read PascalCase paths that do not match the wire format.

### =====================================================================
### 11.1 AUTHENTICATION & SETUP
### =====================================================================

### 11.1.1 Login as Company Admin - Expect 200 OK
# @name companyAdminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "email": "{{companyAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{companyAdminPassword}}"
}

?? status == 200

@companyAdminToken = {{companyAdminLogin.data.token}}

### 11.1.2 Login as Deputy Admin - Expect 200 OK
# @name deputyAdminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "email": "{{deputyAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{deputyAdminPassword}}"
}

?? status == 200

@deputyAdminToken = {{deputyAdminLogin.data.token}}

### =====================================================================
### 11.2 STANDARD SEEDED TEMPLATES
### =====================================================================

### 11.2.1 Every tenant is provisioned with the five standard service templates - Expect 200 OK
### MAINTENANCE_CONTRACT, TECHNICAL_REPORT, FIRE_EQUIPMENT_INVOICE,
### NEW_PROJECT_EXECUTION, SAFETY_DESIGN_DRAWINGS
# @name listTemplates
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 11.2.2 Filter by service category - Expect 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates?serviceCategory=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 11.2.3 Unknown template identifier - Expect 404 Not Found
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 404

### 11.2.4 Unauthenticated access - Expect 401 Unauthorized
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 401

### =====================================================================
### 11.3 TEMPLATE DESIGNER — CREATE
### =====================================================================

### 11.3.1 Create a custom template with ordered steps - Expect 201 Created
### Step order is taken from the position in the array; no explicit index is sent.
# @name createTemplate
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "nameAr": "مسار اختبار مخصص",
  "nameEn": "HTTP Suite Custom Pipeline",
  "serviceCategory": 1,
  "isDefault": false,
  "steps": [
    {
      "stepCode": "INTAKE",
      "displayTitleAr": "استلام الطلب",
      "displayTitleEn": "Request Intake",
      "targetRole": 206,
      "defaultSlaHours": 24,
      "requiresManagerialSignOff": false,
      "formSchemaJson": "{\"fields\":[]}"
    },
    {
      "stepCode": "ENG_REVIEW",
      "displayTitleAr": "المراجعة الهندسية",
      "displayTitleEn": "Engineering Review",
      "targetRole": 202,
      "defaultSlaHours": 72,
      "requiresManagerialSignOff": true,
      "formSchemaJson": null
    }
  ]
}

?? status == 201

@createdTemplateId = {{createTemplate.data}}

### 11.3.2 Read the created template back with its ordered steps - Expect 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### =====================================================================
### 11.4 VALIDATION RULES
### =====================================================================

### 11.4.1 Duplicate step codes must be rejected - Expect 400 Bad Request
### Case-insensitive: two stages named INTAKE make stage-based reporting ambiguous.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "nameAr": "مكرر", "nameEn": "Duplicate Codes", "serviceCategory": 1, "isDefault": false,
  "steps": [
    {"stepCode":"INTAKE","displayTitleAr":"أ","targetRole":206,"defaultSlaHours":1,"requiresManagerialSignOff":false},
    {"stepCode":"intake","displayTitleAr":"ب","targetRole":206,"defaultSlaHours":1,"requiresManagerialSignOff":false}
  ]
}

?? status == 400

### 11.4.2 A platform-level role cannot own a tenant workflow step - Expect 400 Bad Request
### Role 100 is SystemSuperAdmin: assigning it would create a step nobody in the company can action.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "nameAr": "منصة", "nameEn": "Platform Role", "serviceCategory": 1, "isDefault": false,
  "steps": [
    {"stepCode":"INTAKE","displayTitleAr":"أ","targetRole":100,"defaultSlaHours":1,"requiresManagerialSignOff":false}
  ]
}

?? status == 400

### 11.4.3 Malformed form schema JSON must be rejected at design time - Expect 400 Bad Request
### Storing invalid JSON would fail later during intake, with an error the designer cannot connect
### to what they saved.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "nameAr": "جيسون", "nameEn": "Bad Schema", "serviceCategory": 1, "isDefault": false,
  "steps": [
    {"stepCode":"INTAKE","displayTitleAr":"أ","targetRole":206,"defaultSlaHours":1,"requiresManagerialSignOff":false,"formSchemaJson":"{not valid json"}
  ]
}

?? status == 400

### 11.4.4 A template with no steps must be rejected - Expect 400 Bad Request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "nameAr": "فارغ", "nameEn": "No Steps", "serviceCategory": 1, "isDefault": false, "steps": []
}

?? status == 400

### 11.4.5 A negative SLA window must be rejected - Expect 400 Bad Request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "nameAr": "سالب", "nameEn": "Negative SLA", "serviceCategory": 1, "isDefault": false,
  "steps": [
    {"stepCode":"INTAKE","displayTitleAr":"أ","targetRole":206,"defaultSlaHours":-5,"requiresManagerialSignOff":false}
  ]
}

?? status == 400

### =====================================================================
### 11.5 TEMPLATE DESIGNER — UPDATE, CLONE, DEFAULT, ARCHIVE
### =====================================================================

### 11.5.1 Update replaces the step sequence wholesale - Expect 200 OK
### Previous steps are retired rather than deleted: jobs already running reference them by id.
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "id": "{{createdTemplateId}}",
  "nameAr": "مسار محدث",
  "nameEn": "HTTP Suite Updated Pipeline",
  "serviceCategory": 1,
  "steps": [
    {"stepCode":"STAGE_A","displayTitleAr":"أ","displayTitleEn":"Stage A","targetRole":206,"defaultSlaHours":12,"requiresManagerialSignOff":false},
    {"stepCode":"STAGE_B","displayTitleAr":"ب","displayTitleEn":"Stage B","targetRole":203,"defaultSlaHours":36,"requiresManagerialSignOff":true},
    {"stepCode":"STAGE_C","displayTitleAr":"ج","displayTitleEn":"Stage C","targetRole":200,"defaultSlaHours":8,"requiresManagerialSignOff":true}
  ]
}

?? status == 200

### 11.5.2 Clone copies the steps but never the default flag - Expect 201 Created
# @name cloneTemplate
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}/clone
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "nameAr": "نسخة من المسار",
  "nameEn": "HTTP Suite Cloned Pipeline"
}

?? status == 201

@clonedTemplateId = {{cloneTemplate.data}}

### 11.5.3 Promoting a template demotes the previous default in its category - Expect 200 OK
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}/set-default
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 11.5.4 The category's default cannot be archived - Expect 400 Bad Request
### A category left with no default would give new requests no pipeline to follow. The tenant must
### nominate a successor first rather than have one promoted arbitrarily on their behalf.
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 400

### 11.5.5 A non-default template can be archived - Expect 200 OK
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{clonedTemplateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 11.5.6 An archived template cannot become the default - Expect 400 Bad Request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{clonedTemplateId}}/set-default
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 400

### =====================================================================
### 11.6 SOVEREIGN / OPERATIONAL AUTHORIZATION BOUNDARY
### =====================================================================
### DeputyAdmin reads the pipeline they work in, but cannot redesign the process itself —
### the same split already enforced for branding, SEO, and financial policy.

### 11.6.1 DeputyAdmin CAN list templates - Expect 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 11.6.2 DeputyAdmin CAN read a single template - Expect 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 11.6.3 DeputyAdmin CANNOT create a template - Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "nameAr": "ممنوع", "nameEn": "Forbidden", "serviceCategory": 1, "isDefault": false,
  "steps": [
    {"stepCode":"INTAKE","displayTitleAr":"أ","targetRole":206,"defaultSlaHours":1,"requiresManagerialSignOff":false}
  ]
}

?? status == 403

### 11.6.4 DeputyAdmin CANNOT update a template - Expect 403 Forbidden
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "id": "{{createdTemplateId}}", "nameAr": "ممنوع", "serviceCategory": 1,
  "steps": [
    {"stepCode":"INTAKE","displayTitleAr":"أ","targetRole":206,"defaultSlaHours":1,"requiresManagerialSignOff":false}
  ]
}

?? status == 403

### 11.6.5 DeputyAdmin CANNOT clone a template - Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}/clone
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "nameAr": "ممنوع", "nameEn": "Forbidden Clone" }

?? status == 403

### 11.6.6 DeputyAdmin CANNOT change the default template - Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}/set-default
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 403

### 11.6.7 DeputyAdmin CANNOT archive a template - Expect 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates/{{createdTemplateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 403
